{"id":82,"mal_id":82,"title":"Kidou Senshi Gundam 0080: Pocket no Naka no Sensou","englishTitle":"Mobile Suit Gundam 0080: War in the Pocket","title_english":"Mobile Suit Gundam 0080: War in the Pocket","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":[],"en":"Mobile Suit Gundam 0080: War in the Pocket","ja":"機動戦士ガンダム 0080 ポケットの中の戦争"},"synopsis":"Alfred Izuruha is a 10-year-old who lives in the neutral colony cluster of Side 6 and, like most boys his age, is obsessed with the war between the Earth Federation and the Principality of Zeon. Unbeknownst to him, Al's next-door neighbor, Christina, is the test pilot of a prototype Gundam being developed in secret by the Earth Federation in the colony. A Zeon Special Forces team is assembled and tasked with infiltrating the colony in order to either steal or destroy it.\n\nWhen a skirmish breaks out between the Federation and infiltrating Zeon forces, the fascinated Alfred stumbles upon a Zaku mobile suit that has been shot down, piloted by Zeon rookie Bernard \"Bernie\" Wiseman. After this encounter, the two start a mutual friendship, so Alfred can learn more about the war that interests him so much, and Bernie can acquire inside information about the colony to aid his team's mission.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":null,"type":"OVA","media_type":"ova","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1640,"average_episode_duration":1640,"startDate":"1989-03-25","start_date":"1989-03-25","endDate":"1989-08-25","end_date":"1989-08-25","season":"winter","year":1989,"start_season":{"year":1989,"season":"winter"},"episodes":6,"num_episodes":6,"score":8.03,"mean":8.03,"numListUsers":72661,"num_list_users":72661,"genres":[{"id":8,"name":"Drama"},{"id":18,"name":"Mecha"},{"id":38,"name":"Military"},{"id":24,"name":"Sci-Fi"},{"id":29,"name":"Space"}],"studios":[{"id":14,"name":"Sunrise"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/21fk0W388vXQ4TpQ2iZgGzXqwru.jpg","logo_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300